1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:05,767
You're running a race. Just before the finish line, you overtake the person in second place.

2
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:09,183
What place are you in now? You have 10 seconds. Think!

3
00:00:17,983 --> 00:00:18,798
Second place!

4
00:00:19,098 --> 00:00:25,802
You took their spot, so now you're second. The leader is still ahead of you. Most people say first. Did you?

5
00:00:26,102 --> 00:00:29,188
Did you get it right? Follow for a new riddle every day!
